==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|idiomatic|lang=en}} A [[motion picture]] that generates relatively low [[revenue]] at the [[box office]], especially that which is less than the budget for the motion picture.
#: ''My favorite movie was a giant '''box-office bomb.'''''

====Synonyms====
* [[flop]]
* [[turkey]]

====Antonyms====
* [[blockbuster]]

